@group B
@commands `/give @p creativedelight:wooden_bucket`, and `wooden_water_bucket`, `wooden_sap_bucket`, `wooden_milk_bucket`, `wooden_honey_bucket`; recipe check for the tree tapper with an iron and a wooden bucket, and the wooden bucket from planks
@pass All five items exist; one tapper recipe accepts either bucket; boot log has no Creative Delight error
@fails Registry or recipe id
@from batches/r1115/p9_a1.qb
> zq items creativedelight:wooden_
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_water_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_sap_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_milk_bucket
> give ob8 creativedelight:wooden_honey_bucket
